tts:ruby="text" begin="17.145" end="17.880">ま</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="17.880" end="18.059">ち</span></span></span><span begin="18.059" end="18.315">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">景</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="18.315" end="18.472">け</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">色</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="18.472" end="18.935">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="18.935" end="19.139">き</span></span></span><span begin="19.139" end="19.863">に</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">佇</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="20.343" end="20.941">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="20.941" end="21.431">た</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="21.431" end="21.919">ず</span></span></span><span begin="21.919" end="22.478">む</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">独</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="22.478" end="23.129">ひ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="23.129" end="23.538">と</span></span></span><span begin="23.538" end="24.192">り</span><span begin="24.192" end="25.943">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">独自一人寄身于夜暗来袭的大街晚景里</span></p><p begin="26.727" end="32.632" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">霞</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="26.727" end="27.232">か</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="27.232" end="27.882">す</span></span></span><span begin="27.882" end="28.195">む</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="28.195" end="28.871">そ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="28.871" end="29.545">ら</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">揺</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="29.545" end="29.912">ゆ</span></span></span><span begin="29.912" end="30.723">ら</span><span begin="30.723" end="30.941">ぐ</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">空</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="30.941" end="31.141">く</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="31.141" end="31.339">う</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">気</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="31.339" end="31.674">き</span></span></span><span begin="31.674" end="31.822">さ</span><span begin="31.822" end="32.632">え</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">就连色染晚霞的天空 摇动的空气</span></p><p begin="33.103" end="39.161" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="33.103" end="33.605">ず</span><span begin="33.605" end="33.742">っ</span><span begin="33.742" end="34.340">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="34.340" end="34.725">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="34.725" end="35.317">に</span></span></span><span begin="35.317" end="36.018">か</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">探</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="36.242" end="36.943">さ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="36.943" end="37.396">か</span></span></span><span begin="37.396" end="37.938">し</span><span begin="37.938" end="39.161">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">也像是在寻觅着什么</span></p><p begin="39.451" end="44.967" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">沈</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.451" end="40.035">し</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="40.035" end="40.741">ず</span></span></span><span begin="40.741" end="42.094">む</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">暗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="42.094" end="42.346">く</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="42.346" end="42.543">ら</span></span></span><span begin="42.543" end="42.746">い</s