an tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">動</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:00.340" end="1:01.100">ど</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:01.100" end="1:01.552">う</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">振</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:01.940" end="1:02.544">ふ</span></span></span><span begin="1:02.544" end="1:03.542">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">切</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:03.542" end="1:04.188">き</span></span></span><span begin="1:04.188" end="1:04.747">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">ゲージ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:04.747" end="1:07.834">Gauge</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">胸中高扬的鼓动早已超越度量的标尺</span></p><p begin="1:08.337" end="1:14.342" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">溢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:08.337" end="1:08.987">あ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:08.987" end="1:09.875">ふ</span></span></span><span begin="1:09.875" end="1:10.553">れ</span><span begin="1:10.553" end="1:11.134">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">涙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.134" end="1:11.537">な</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.537" end="1:12.128">み</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:12.128" end="1:12.690">だ</span></span></span><span begin="1:12.690" end="1:13.144">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">蹴</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.144" end="1:13.300">け</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">散</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:13.300" end="1:13.508">ち</span></span></span><span begin="1:13.508" end="1:13.649">ら</span><span begin="1:13.649" end="1:14.342">せ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">拒绝溢出的眼泪</span></p><p begin="1:14.692" end="1:20.882" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夢</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:14.692" end="1:15.319">ゆ</span><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:15.319" end="1:16.244">め</span></span></span><span begin="1:16.244" end="1:16.923">つ</span><span begin="1:16.923" end="1:17.531">か</span><span begin="1:17.531" end="1:17.957">ん</span><span begin="1:17.957" end="1:20.882">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">紧抱梦想</span></p></div></body></tt>